# Pugnacious Hammerskull: "Whenever this creature attacks while you don't control another Dinosaur, put a stun counter on it." The "while" is
# asked only as it attacks (CR 603.2), never again as the trigger resolves (the ruling: "it doesn't matter whether or not you control one as its
# ability resolves"). Bot1 attacks alone on turn 3 with no other Dinosaur, and with the trigger on the stack makes its Ornithopter a Dinosaur
# with Stegron the Dinosaur Man's Dinosaur Formula from hand. The trigger still resolves: one stun counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Pugnacious Hammerskull
Ornithopter
Stegron the Dinosaur Man
Mox Pearl
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pugnacious Hammerskull.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Pugnacious Hammerskull > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stegron the Dinosaur Man.Activate(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Subtypes = Dinosaur; Thopter
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Battlefield.Pugnacious Hammerskull.Counters.Stun = 1
